| 1 | Policy sponsorship and public consultation | Treasury (Minister) | Phase 1+ | Starts now, in parallel with Phase 0 |
| 2 | Housing Pool investment option / SPV within an existing RSE licence; SPS 530 and CPS 230 compliance | Trustee; supervised by APRA | Phase 0 | Starts now |
| 3 | Product disclosure and design-and-distribution obligations | Trustee; ASIC | Phase 0 | In parallel with 2 |
| 4 | Enhanced regulatory sandbox notification (only if a new unlicensed provider is used) | Provider; ASIC | Phase 0 (optional) | In parallel; ASIC has a 30-day assessment window |
| 5 | SMSF compliance (deed, investment strategy, valuation) | SMSF trustees; ATO | Phase 0B | In parallel |
| 6 | SIS Regulations amendment (charges over fund assets / member benefits) | Treasury drafts; Governor-General makes; subject to Parliamentary disallowance | Phase 1 | Drafted during Phase 0; made after Phase 0 gate |
| 7 | Release-of-benefit / enforcement pathway; tax treatment | Treasury; ATO | Phase 1 | With 6 |
| 8 | Responsible lending for participating loans | Lenders (existing credit licences); ASIC | Phase 1 | In parallel |
| 9 | Prudential capital treatment of loans secured by the pool | APRA | Phase 1 (non-crypto), Phase 2 (crypto) | In parallel with 6 |
| 10 | Custodian licensing (AFSL, RG 133; Digital Assets Framework Act from 8 April 2027) | Custodians; ASIC | Phase 0B, Phase 2 | Due diligence during Phase 0 |
| 11 | AUSTRAC virtual asset service provider registration and AML/CTF compliance | Custodians / exchanges; AUSTRAC | Phase 0B, Phase 2 | In parallel |
